Hevy's OpenAPI document
-----------------------
    skills/hevy-api/openapi.json
    skills/hevy-api/openapi.corrected.json

`openapi.json` is Hevy's own OpenAPI document, published at
https://api.hevyapp.com/docs and redistributed here unmodified so that the
corrections in `spec-patches.json` have a fixed reference to be checked
against. `openapi.corrected.json` is generated from it.

Copyright in that document, including its descriptions and examples, belongs
to Hevy. Hevy attaches no licence to it. Both files are included for
interoperability, and the MIT grant in LICENSE does not extend to them or to
the Hevy name.

Everything else in this repository is original work under the MIT licence:
the skills, the reference documentation, the client, the checks, and the
corrections themselves.

Prose in the documentation restates facts from Hevy's document in different
words and cites it. Sample payloads in the Markdown files reuse example values
from Hevy's document, such as ids and workout titles. Its descriptions are not
reproduced.
